           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•sterilize items placed in infant's mouth (bottle nipples · pacifiers) to prevent reinfection - ⍉response → PO fluconazole"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
