          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•≥12mo mild (<50% of oral mucosa · ⍉deep erosive lesions): nystatin susp · nystatin or clotrimazole lozenges (⍉if <4yo - choking hazard)"
           }
          ]
         },
